    mz:justification "Examined: the ArchiMate and UAF 'capability' elements (an ability of an organization or system, as here) and ISO/IEC/IEEE 15288 and 12207 (system capability); none publishes an IRI, and Spec Kit's 'feature' is the term this one replaces. Candidates to examine further: a published ArchiMate or UAF vocabulary (to verify). Decision pending (0018-standards-first FR-005)." ;
